                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Kelly Sanderson Schrems&amp;nbsp;has been appointed UK Vice President and General Manager, effective&amp;nbsp;11th&amp;nbsp;May 2026&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>An internal appointment,&amp;nbsp;Kelly&amp;nbsp;takes on the position&amp;nbsp;having held senior&amp;nbsp;US and&amp;nbsp;Global&amp;nbsp;roles in&amp;nbsp;her&amp;nbsp;13-year career at AbbVie&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Kelly&amp;nbsp;succeeds&amp;nbsp;Steve Hopkinson, who was appointed in&amp;nbsp;2024&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </container3>
