                            <container4
                                cq:styleIds="[1653545847150,1653242825678,1653545825687,1653545835982]"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/container/v2/container">
                                <text2
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-11T05:52:39.264-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;p>&lt;b>Maidenhead, UK,&amp;nbsp;11&amp;nbsp;May,&amp;nbsp;2026&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;– AbbVie (NYSE: ABBV)&amp;nbsp;today&amp;nbsp;announced that&amp;nbsp;Kelly Sanderson Schrems&amp;nbsp;has been appointed&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;Vice President&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;General Manager, UK.&amp;nbsp;With effect from&amp;nbsp;11th&amp;nbsp;May 2026,&amp;nbsp;Kelly&amp;nbsp;succeeds&amp;nbsp;Steve Hopkinson&amp;nbsp;who has been appointed&amp;nbsp;Vice President&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;US Dermatology,&amp;nbsp;after&amp;nbsp;two&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;in the UK&amp;nbsp;Vice President and General Manager role.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Kelly brings 13&amp;nbsp;years of experience at AbbVie across commercial, operational, and strategic leadership roles in the US and Europe. Most recently, she served as Vice President of Commercial Operations for AbbVie's Oncology franchise. She has previous experience in the UK market, having spent a year in AbbVie UK’s Oncology franchise. Prior to joining AbbVie, Kelly was a management consultant at McKinsey &amp;amp; Company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Commenting on her appointment, Kelly said “I’m delighted to be returning to the UK to lead AbbVie’s&amp;nbsp;UK&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;and to&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;building on the exceptional progress Steve has driven&amp;nbsp;during his time as General Manager.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>It is&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;important time to be stepping into this role. The 10 Year Health&amp;nbsp;and Life Sciences Sector&amp;nbsp;plans&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;evolving access landscape are&amp;nbsp;setting the direction for healthcare in the UK.&amp;nbsp;I look forward to&amp;nbsp;working in&amp;nbsp;partnership with the NHS, policymakers and the wider life sciences community&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;support an environment where innovation can&amp;nbsp;thrive for the benefit of patients, the health system and the UK economy.”&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;>Kelly received her Master of Business Administration from the Kellogg School of Management at Northwestern University. She also attended the University of Michigan where she earned a Master of Science in Industrial and Operations Engineering and a Bachelor of Science in Materials Science and Engineering.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-ENDS-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>NOTES TO EDITORS&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Picture&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>A&amp;nbsp;picture of&amp;nbsp;Kelly Sanderson Schrems&amp;nbsp;is available on request.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;b>About AbbVie&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie's mission is to discover and deliver innovative medicines and solutions that solve serious health issues today and address the medical challenges of tomorrow. We strive to have a remarkable impact on people's lives across several key therapeutic areas –&amp;nbsp;immunology,&amp;nbsp; neuroscience,&amp;nbsp;oncology&amp;nbsp;– and products and services in our Allergan Aesthetics portfolio. For more information about AbbVie, please visit us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.co.uk/&quot;>abbvie.co.uk&lt;/a>. Follow&amp;nbsp;us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>on LinkedIn,&amp;nbsp;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7451963698975473664/?actorCompanyId=110551994&quot;>AbbVie | UK&lt;/a>)&amp;nbsp;and YouTube (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@abbvie-uk&quot;>@abbvieuk6755&lt;/a>).&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot;>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;tbody>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&lt;b>UK&amp;nbsp;Media:&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;td>&lt;b>Or&lt;/b>&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>Natalie&amp;nbsp;Bennett&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;td>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; UK Media Relations&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>+44 (0) 7977 678 377&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;td>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; +44 (0)&amp;nbsp;1628 925200&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;td>&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:Natalie.Bennett@abbvie.com&quot;>Natalie.Bennett@abbvie.com&lt;/a>&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;td>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:UKMediaRelations@abbvie.com&quot;>UKMediaRelations@abbvie.com&lt;/a>&lt;/td>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/tr>&lt;/tbody>&lt;/table>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
